  "post_content": "<p>La Onda Big Band y Ploma Teatre, con las cantantes Sofia Royo y B&aacute;rbara Breva, han presentado en el teatro M&oacute;naco el espect&aacute;culo Scrooge Un cuento de Navidad, producci&oacute;n original y gui&oacute;n adaptado de Lisbeth Freites G.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_8185.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Basado en la novela A Christmas Carol&#39;s, de Charles Dicken, la direcci&oacute;n de teatro y revisi&oacute;n del gui&oacute;n es de Eduard Costa, actor protagonista junto a Vicent Pastor, Laura Giner y Marc Segura. El director musical es Manolo D&iacute;az.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8092.jpg\" alt=\"img_8092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8093.jpg\" alt=\"img_8093\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8095.jpg\" alt=\"img_8095\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8096.jpg\" alt=\"img_8096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8097.jpg\" alt=\"img_8097\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8098.jpg\" alt=\"img_8098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondabigbandplomateatrescrooge/img_8100.jpg\" alt=\"img_8100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondab